erial that is softer than cashmere.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"product.asp?itemid=3172\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42203894595,"sku":"30x40PLF-CLG","price":49.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-quick-photo-collage-plush-fleece-blanket-30-x-40-1.jpg?v=1506965992"},{"product_id":"photo-collage-plush-fleece-blanket-60-x-50","title":"Quick Collage Plush Fleece Blanket-10 Image Template- 50\" x 60\"","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA slightly snugglier option than our Polar Fleece – thicker and fuzzier. 1\/4 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Great for chilly plane cabins or car rides. This option allows you to quickly and easily design a 10 image collage with our ready to use template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e50\" x 60\"\u003c\/